        {
          "text": "Lino kakuli inzala kuciindi ca-Davida myaaka yotatwe. Elyo Davida wakabuzya makani kuli-Jehova, nkabela Jehova wakati, Nkikaambo ka­ Saulo aluzubo lwakwe lwabulowa, nkaambo wakajaya ba-Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
