                  "text": "Jos 9:3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami wakaita ba-Gibeoni akubaambila makani, (Aba ba-Gibeoni teebakali babana ba-Israyeli pe, kabali baba-Amori ibakasyaala, ba-Israyeli mbubakatangana abo cizuminano. Nkabela Saulo wakali kuyanda kubajaya mukusungwaala kwakwe nkwaakasungwaalila bana ba-Israyeli aba-Juda). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
