        {
          "text": "tupegwe bantu bali musanu ababili babana bakwe, kuti tubasine kumeso aa-Jehova muGibeya munzi wa-Saulo musale wa-Jehova. Mpawo mwami wakati, Mbubo, ndamupa. ",
