            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino musule lyayaaya kwakalwigwa inkondo aimwi aba-Filisti ku-Gobu, Mpawo Sibekai mu-Husai wakajaya Safi, umwi wabana ba-Rafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimwi inkondo yakalwigwa aba-Filisti ku-Gobu, nkabela Elhanani mwana waJareoregimu waku-Betelehemu wakajaya munyina Goliati mu-Giti, nguwakajisi isumo lili aluti mbuli cisamu casikuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mak 20:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kwakalwigwa inkondo aba-Filisti ku-Gati. Oko kakuli umwi muntu mupati loko, wakali aminwe iili musanu aumwi kumaanza aakwe oonse obile, atukumo tuli musanu akamwi kuzituta zyakwe, nkokuti zyoonse zyakali makumi obile azine. Oyu alakwe wakazyalwa a-Rafa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkabela naakasampaula baIsrayeli, wakamujaya jonatani mwana wa-Simeyi munyina Davida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bone mbaakazyala Rafa ku-Gati, nkabela boonse bakajayigwa kumaanza aa-Davida abalanda bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
